flowchart LR
    Web[웹 클라이언트]:::client
    Mobile[모바일]:::client
    Admin[운영자 콘솔]:::client

    Web --> Nginx
    Mobile --> Nginx
    Admin --> Nginx

    subgraph Transentia[Transentia 백엔드]
        Nginx[Nginx Load Balancer]:::infra
        TransferAPI[Transfer-API :8080<br/>송금/계좌 관리]:::svc
        FdsAPI[FDS-API :8082<br/>이상거래 탐지]:::svc
        Relay[Transfer-Relay<br/>Outbox 발행]:::svc
    end

    Nginx -->|/api/transfers| TransferAPI
    Nginx -->|/api/fds| FdsAPI
    TransferAPI -.->|outbox| Relay

    Bank[(은행 정산망<br/>미구현)]:::external
    TransferAPI -.->|placeholder| Bank

    classDef client fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1e40af,color:#1e3a8a
    classDef svc fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d
    classDef infra fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#a16207,color:#713f12
    classDef external fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#6b7280,color:#374151,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
